,{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィンランド民謡\nサライかと思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ声リレーは\n中田はスタジオにずっといて\nどこも行かなかった人だったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国からこんなに協力してもらえて\n本当に嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動してしまいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに\n濃ゆい2日間は\n人生で初めてですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4年目にして\nさらにメンバーの絆が深まった気がします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォローしあいながら\n一緒に46時間駆け抜けたメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間始まる前から\n寝ないで準備してくださったスタッフさん方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n見てくださったみなさん\n本当に本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-30530":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、髪の毛を切ってから\nずっとウェーブばっかり\nしていたから久しぶりに\nポニーテールにしました♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2016/02/13/4957810/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外と結ぶとまだまだ\n長いんだな〜って実感します( ´･ᴗ･` )\nしばらくはこのくらいの長さで\nいこうって考えるんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェーブでふわふわさせてるのとか\n大好きだから前髪とかもシースルーバング\nが今はお気に入りです♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡\nプライベートで一番してるのは\n「\nちょんちょこりんヘアかな。\n」\n笑い\n↑\n自分で名付けました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2016/02/13/4957810/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと昔の写真だけど...\n丁度つむじ周辺の髪の毛を前髪含めて\nちょっこだけ結んで横に長してリボンで\n止めたりするヘアのことです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが「ちょんちょこりんヘアー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら女の子はしてみてね？\n可愛いよ、この髪型大好きよ？◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ね、てぃーちゃんとずっと\n行きたかったカフェに行ってきました\n去年から約束してたんだよ 笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたかったのはアイスが中に入ってて\nマシュマロでコーディングされてる物\nなんだけどね？その周りをガスバーナーで\n店員さんが焼いてくれるんだよ♡♡♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2016/02/13/4957810/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(\nた・ま・ら・ん・♡\n)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはまた絶対食べに行きたいね\nってお話してたけど他にも行きたい\nとこがあるからまだまだ先に\nなりそうです(´；ω；｀)残念"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたいとこといえば愛媛県の道後温泉も\n行ってみたいの!!蜷川実花さんとの\nコラボ浴衣にコラボ温泉(´·_·｀)\n画像検索して見てばっかり!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際にこのブログ読んでる方で\n行った方っていらっしゃるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対可愛いんだろうな\n可愛いもの大好き、\n大人になってもやっぱり\nピンクが1番好きです♡\nピンクにまみれたいまる\\( ¨̮ )/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*⃝̣◌⑅⃝◍♡◌*⃝̥◍♡*⃝̣◌⑅⃝◍♡◌*⃝̥◍♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前のゲストは\nGLIDERの栗田さんでした。\nおに魂ファミリーさんは久しぶり\nだったから嬉しかったな( ´›ω‹｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2016/02/13/4957810/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栗田さんはサウナにはまってるらしくて\nそのお話を聞いてたら私も凄い\n興味が湧いちゃった〜\n汗かくのって気持ちいいですよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお風呂に携帯とか持ち込む派だから\nDVDとか見てると1時間は余裕で\n湯船に浸かってたりするんだけど\nまた、サウナとは違うんだろうな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に湯船にバスソルトをいれて\n入ると普通のお湯に浸かるより\n温暖効果が倍増して体がぽかぽか...\nこれがまた最高なのよ⍤⃝♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなこと言ってたらお風呂\n早く入りたくなってきた〜\nわーーーーーーーーーー！\nお風呂...おっふっろーーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-56490":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP80GBCEZ25BFR9J9Z9EAW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n お餅〜　\n どうもです。\n \n 最近は寝る前にゲームをして\n 本を読んでから寝ています\n 寝る前は本当はテレビや携帯の光を浴びないほうがいいのですが、つい、してしまいます\n 荒野行動でこの間、2人倒せたんだけどね\n 今月中に1回戦で5人倒すのを目標にしてます❤︎\n \n \n \n あとはDEANさんのhalfmoon\n を聴きながらボーッと月を見たり\n \n 結構昼間でも空を見上げてます\n 天気、空模様、なんか気になる\n \n \n とりあえず早寝しなきゃ〜\n 昨日は親友と久しぶりに電話をしました\n 元気そうで何よりです☺︎\n お互い変わらないでいたいな\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP81G2MG1VKVEYF08BFFG5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ちなみにお味噌汁ブームで\n 赤味噌派、具材はしじみが好き\n 毎日飲みたいなぁ\n ほっこりします。\n 鍋食べながらお味噌汁飲むのは変ですかね、、？\n \n \n \n \n そして19日から46時間TVが始まりますね〜\n いよいよ〜\n \n \n \n 2期生企画は20日の21:00からです！\n ちなみに20日の夜は4期生のまゆちゃんと\n MCをやらせていただきます☺︎\n \n 頼りないけど頑張ります...>_<...\n みなさんも頑張って夜更かしして\n 見てくださいっ\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP82JD8TF7C9PEWDBJQKE2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP83KHXJ0KJQD6JXGM0YMD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n いろんな髪型。\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFP85AP85DXNFEHFZ5XVYH9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n おやすみ〜\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22033":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに似顔絵クイズあるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信長協奏曲最高過ぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リピート再生してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山崎怜奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第10話のときに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅井長政の子供たちが一瞬だけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てきたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何年か前の大河ドラマの「江」を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、茶々と初と江だ～かわいい～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだこんなちっちゃいんだ～へ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか思いながら観てました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感慨深かったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いねぇ、ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終話が楽しみです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画ちゃんと読んだことないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原作マンガ読みたいもん。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれか貸してください。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大河ドラマの軍師官兵衛も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/21に終わっちゃうんだよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白かったからもう一周みようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年の花燃ゆも楽しみ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニタニタ(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足の裏な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深爪な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/12  アンダーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドシーズンファイナル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/13、14  クリスマスライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、直前の11日まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期末考査があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日までのリハに全く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加できなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブ共に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンコールから登場させて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただくことになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、アンコールの煽りのときは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めいっぱい皆さんに顔見せしようと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてもらおうと思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縦横無尽に駆けずり回っては"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目立つところに行こうとしてました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ちょっとだけ、悔いを言うと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一曲ずつ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センター曲が与えられる企画があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも当然私だけできなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと前に行きたいと思っても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特にセンターやりたいとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ったことは無かったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも初めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターやりたいなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちが起こりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、いつか、センターを努められる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機会があったときには、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人一倍、輝いてみせます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつになるかわからないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待っていてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が、アンコールからしか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出られないのを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩方も気にしてくださって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華さんと話したときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥さんに抱きついたときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩が声かけてくれたときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いちゃったんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ悔しかったからだけじゃなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったんです(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんと優里さんとカメラ前で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わちゃわちゃしたのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカパー!に放送されたときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんがライブ中の煽りのときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私をひっぱって一緒にモニターカメラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に映ろうとしてくれたときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華さんにライブ中に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭ポンポンされたときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子とハイタッチしたときも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ全部終わったあとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまさんが連絡くれたときも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて泣きそうでした(´;ω;`)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙腺激ゆるなんです、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その辺に泣きべそかいて立ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなち泣き虫～(。-∀-)♡って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥さんに笑われた(._.)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、アンコールからだったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しタオルとか、うちわとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黄色＆白サイリウムとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないんだろうなぁ～...って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心のどこかで少し寂しく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思っていたんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日間とも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブでは特に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのライブで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番かもしれないレベルで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけることができて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しかった！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー発信の、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩の紫サイリウム企画も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても綺麗でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"800人→8,000人となると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見える景色も全然違くて...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり、規模が大きくなっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブのあの一体感は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健在していて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場にいれることが幸せでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はどっちの景色も好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブセカンドシーズン、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の18公演は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前半戦、ケガで出れなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後半からの参戦になってしまったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有明コロシアムでのファイナルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学業でアンコールからだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励ましてくれた皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれた皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご心配おかけしてすみませんでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして発表された乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3周年バースデーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in西武ドーム、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回がこうい