ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真撮影用にあった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手持ちグッズのミニツリーを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高速で振ってるときの写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあとこのミニツリーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上下分裂して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"組み立て式であったことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知るのだった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと直して返却しました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/12/18/3042517/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね(  ´ω`  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントいつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、元気でる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなふぉとの回答も待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週の個握も楽しみーヽ(*･ω･*)ノ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに話そうかなーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなち"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-36093":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。日向坂46の富田鈴花です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46さんの｢THE LAST LIVE｣を拝見しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break